favicon.svg, favicon-tile.svg, favicon.ico, apple-touch-icon.png
    The MagicPipes mark. The bitmaps come from favicon-tile.svg (scripts/favicons.sh).

LICENSE-lucide
    The license of the line icons in ../icons.rs and the copy and check icons in ../ui.js.
    Source: lucide-static 0.460.0 (https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide), ISC.
    Icons: app-window, arrow-left, arrow-up-right, check, copy, download, ellipsis, folder, globe,
    lock, monitor, plug, radio, terminal, triangle-alert. Only the paths are copied: the stroke width (1.5
    instead of 2) and everything else about how they look comes from the UI's own styles.
